        lrsss:R-22.1_s._99 ;
    skos:scopeNote "Applies to health and social services bodies, including private professional offices and specialised medical centres (s. 4 and Schedule II); for the health information they hold it replaces the private-sector Act (P-39.1 s. 3, para. 3)."@en .

